{
  "id": "868",
  "title": "Higher or Lower?",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-12-25",
  "synopsis": "Little Le wants Paul to hang up a picture. But it’s hard to explain exactly where…",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/868/6a7ad7bafbfb0f8a702576bcc08bb9148048dde8.mp3?1576959573",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "是高还是低？\n\n小乐：你把这幅画挂起来吧！\n保罗：好！\n（几分钟后）\n保罗：小乐，你帮我看看。\n小乐：好。稍微往左一点，稍微高一点。\n保罗：现在呢？\n小乐：稍微高了一点。\n保罗：现在呢？\n小乐：不是，保罗，我刚才是说“太高了，低一点儿”。\n保罗：你不是说“稍微高了一点吗”？\n小乐：对啊，“稍微高了一点”就是“太高了，要你放低一点儿”的意思；“稍微高一点”就是“要你放高一点儿，因为太低了”。\n保罗：天啊！这个“稍微”也太难了吧！",
    "traditional": "是高還是低？\n\n小樂：你把這幅畫掛起來吧！\n保羅：好！\n（幾分鐘後）\n保羅：小樂，你幫我看看。\n小樂：好。稍微往左一點，稍微高一點。\n保羅：現在呢？\n小樂：稍微高了一點。\n保羅：現在呢？\n小樂：不是，保羅，我剛才是說“太高了，低一點兒”。\n保羅：你不是說“稍微高了一點嗎”？\n小樂：對啊，“稍微高了一點”就是“太高了，要你放低一點兒”的意思；“稍微高一點”就是“要你放高一點兒，因為太低了”。\n保羅：天啊！這個“稍微”也太難了吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Is it high or low?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你把这幅画挂起来吧！",
      "traditional": "小樂：你把這幅畫掛起來吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ bǎ zhè fú huà guà qǐ lái ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You take this picture and hang it up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：好！",
      "traditional": "保羅：好！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: OK!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "（几分钟后）",
      "traditional": "（幾分鐘後）",
      "pinyin": "jǐ fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(A few minutes later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：小乐，你帮我看看。",
      "traditional": "保羅：小樂，你幫我看看。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiǎo lè nǐ bāng wǒ kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Little Le, you help me have a look."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：好。稍微往左一点，稍微高一点。",
      "traditional": "小樂：好。稍微往左一點，稍微高一點。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo shāo wēi wǎng zuǒ yì diǎn shāo wēi gāo yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Ok. A little bit towards the left, and a little bit higher."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：现在呢？",
      "traditional": "保羅：現在呢？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiàn zài ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How about now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小乐：稍微高了一点。",
      "traditional": "小樂：稍微高了一點。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shāo wēi gāo le yì diǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: It’s a little bit high."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "保罗：现在呢？",
      "traditional": "保羅：現在呢？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiàn zài ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How about now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小乐：不是，保罗，我刚才是说“太高了，低一点儿”。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不是，保羅，我剛才是說“太高了，低一點兒”。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bú shì bǎo luó wǒ gāng cái shì shuō tài gāo le dī yì diǎn'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No, Paul, what I just said was “too high, a bit lower”."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "保罗：你不是说“稍微高了一点吗”？",
      "traditional": "保羅：你不是說“稍微高了一點嗎”？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ bú shì shuō shāo wēi gāo le yì diǎn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Didn't you say “A little bit high”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "小乐：对啊，“稍微高了一点”就是“太高了，要你放低一点儿”的意思；",
      "traditional": "小樂：對啊，“稍微高了一點”就是“太高了，要你放低一點兒”的意思；",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè duì a shāo wēi gāo le yì diǎn jiù shì tài gāo le yào nǐ fàng dī yì diǎn'r de yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "“稍微高一点”就是“要你放高一点儿，因为太低了”。",
      "traditional": "“稍微高一點”就是“要你放高一點兒，因為太低了”。",
      "pinyin": "shāo wēi gāo yì diǎn jiù shì yào nǐ fàng gāo yì diǎn'r yīn wèi tài dī le",
      "english": "Little Le: Exactly, “a little bit high” means “too high, I want you to put it a bit lower”;"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“A bit higher” is “I want you to put it a little bit higher, because it is too low”."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "保罗：天啊！这个“稍微”也太难了吧！",
      "traditional": "保羅：天啊！這個“稍微”也太難了吧！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó tiān a zhè ge shāo wēi yě tài nán le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Heavens! This “a little bit” is too difficult!"
    }
